lle rock band in tour come veicolo. Ebbe contatti con la CIA, l'MI6, l'IRA e la Mafia. Catturato dalla DEA e condannato a 25 anni di reclusione, fu rilasciato sulla parola nel 1995 dopo 7 anni passati al fresco.","tagline":"43 Alias. 89 Linee telefoniche. Questa è la storia di Howard Marks."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Biopic about 1970s Welsh marijuana trafficker Howard Marks, whose inventive smuggling schemes made him a huge success in the drug trade, as well as leading to dealings with both the IRA and British Intelligence. Based on Marks' biography with the same title.","tagline":"43 Aliases. 89 Phone Lines. This is the Story of Howard Marks."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6zvb0DckPM7q9m75OdUjUwKHx6l.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6zvb0DckPM7q9m75OdUjUwKHx6l.png","language":"en","width":407,"height":285}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4MFbFZYRNX0MmjtW326qtW1LwJN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4MFbFZYRNX0MmjtW326qtW1LwJN.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uag1ajVUMuHTXqkX0H52z0FveON.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uag1ajVUMuHTXqkX0H52z0FveON.jpg","language":"en","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nO6PXkhltFcmRd4nNKJsEUdZvJH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nO6PXkhltFcmRd4nNKJsEUdZvJH.jpg","language":"en","width":535,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e1cNlrz7fdTtIVoQbCO5l66YxND.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e1cNlrz7fdTtIVoQbCO5l66YxND.jpg","language":"en","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qkUCtAMlyybTTBETywGCiA7yRDH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qkUCtAMlyybTTBETywGCiA7yRDH.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1497},{"type":"poster","ur